<title>HONG KONG: China Merchants Direct H1 net up 32 pct.</title>
<headline>China Merchants Direct H1 net up 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   3.3	 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    1.0	 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  0.56 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    3.17	vs 2.40</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3.36	vs 3.16 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Merchants China Direct</p>
<p>				     Investments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 15-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 5</p>
<p>NOTE - China Merchants China Direct is a closed-end investment company.</p>
<p>For the current period, gains on sale of listed investments are not included in the turnover of the group. In order to conform with the current period's presentation, the comparative turnover has also been reclassified and adjusted.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of a wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
